      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Part of the town of Somers, it sits near the Croton River and is known for its semi‑rural character, with historic farmhouses and wooded areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/new-york_shenorock",
